#: ../command-line.rst:3
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "Ukazna vrstica"

#: ../command-line.rst:7
msgid ""
"Galette now proposes a command line interface to manage some tasks. This is "
"accessible through the ``bin/console`` script in Galette root directory:"
msgstr ""
"Galette zdaj ponuja vmesnik ukazne vrstice za upravljanje nekaterih nalog. "
"Dostopen je prek skripte ``bin/console`` v korenskem imeniku Galette:"

#: ../command-line.rst:49
msgid ""
"Some of those commands are meant for developers only (``galette:check-"
"routes``, ``galette:headers:check``, ``galette:seed-fixtures``, "
"``galette:twig-pot-references``), and are not described here."
msgstr ""
"Nekateri od teh ukazov so namenjeni samo razvijalcem (``galette:check-"
"routes``, ``galette:headers:check``, ``galette:seed-fixtures``, "
"``galette:twig-pot-references``) in tukaj niso opisani."

#: ../command-line.rst:51
msgid ""
"You can obtain help for a specific command by using the ``help`` command:"
msgstr "Pomoč za določen ukaz lahko dobite z uporabo ukaza ``help``:"

#: ../command-line.rst:58
msgid "Requirements check"
msgstr "Preverjanje zahtev"

#: ../command-line.rst:60
msgid ""
"This only check for Galette prerequisites, and has no specific arguments."
msgstr "To preverja samo predpogoje za Galette in nima posebnih argumentov."

#: ../command-line.rst:64
msgid ""
"On some systems, PHP configuration may differ between cli and web; therefore "
"it's recommended to check for requirements from the web script "
"``compat_test.php``."
msgstr ""
"V nekaterih sistemih se lahko konfiguracija PHP med vmesnikom CLI in "
"spletnim vmesnikom razlikuje; zato je priporočljivo preveriti zahteve v "
"spletnem skriptu ``compat_test.php``."

#: ../command-line.rst:67
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Namestiteve"

#: ../command-line.rst:69
msgid "This command obviously installs Galette :)"
msgstr "Ta ukaz očitno namesti Galette :)"

#: ../command-line.rst:98
msgid ""
"By default, the script will check for an existing configuration file, you "
"can ignore that using the ``--ignore-config`` option."
msgstr ""
"Skript bo privzeto preveril obstoječo konfiguracijsko datoteko, to lahko "
"prezrete z možnostjo ``--ignore-config``."

#: ../command-line.rst:100
msgid ""
"Required options that have not been provided on script call will be asked "
"interactively."
msgstr ""
"Zahtevane možnosti, ki niso bile podane ob klicu skripte, bodo zahtevane "
"interaktivno."

#: ../command-line.rst:150
msgid "Super administrator password"
msgstr "Geslo superskrbnika"

#: ../command-line.rst:154
msgid ""
"The super administrator password is normally changed from **My account**, "
"then **My information**, or from the :ref:`advanced configuration "
"<advanced_config>` page. Both require to be logged in, which is of little "
"help the day the password is lost: the super administrator is not a member, "
"so it cannot use the *forgotten password* form either."
msgstr ""
"Geslo superadministratorja se običajno spremeni v razdelku **Moj račun** in "
"nato **Moji podatki** ali pa na strani :ref:`napredne konfiguracije "
"<advanced_config>`. V obeh primerih je potrebna prijava, kar pa ne pomaga "
"dosti, če geslo pozabite: superadministrator ni član, zato ne more uporabiti "
"obrazca *forgotten password* za primer pozabljenega gesla."

#: ../command-line.rst:156
msgid ""
"This command is the way back in. It runs on the machine hosting Galette, and "
"that access stands as the authentication."
msgstr ""
"Ta ukaz je pot nazaj. Zažene se na računalniku, ki gosti Galette, in ta "
"dostop predstavlja avtentikacijo."

#: ../command-line.rst:176
msgid ""
"There is no option to pass the password with: it is only ever read from a "
"hidden prompt, so that it does not end up in your shell history nor in the "
"process list of the machine. It is asked twice, and the two answers must "
"match."
msgstr ""
"Gesla ni mogoče posredovati: vedno se prebere samo iz skritega poziva, tako "
"da ne konča v vaši zgodovini ukazne lupine ali na seznamu procesov stroja. "
"Vpraša se dvakrat in odgovora se morata ujemati."

#: ../command-line.rst:195
msgid ""
"The login is displayed so you know which account you just changed, but the "
"command does not touch it. Change it from **My account**, then **My "
"information**, as usual."
msgstr ""
"Prikazano je uporabniško ime, da veste, kateri račun ste pravkar spremenili, "
"vendar ga ukaz sam ne spreminja. Spremenite ga v razdelku **Moj račun** in "
"nato **Moji podatki**, kot običajno."

#: ../command-line.rst:197
msgid ""
"The new password must satisfy the :ref:`password rules <password_rules>` of "
"your instance, exactly as it would from the web interface."
msgstr ""
"Novo geslo mora izpolnjevati :ref:`pravila za gesla <password_rules>` vaše "
"instance, povsem enako kot pri uporabi spletnega vmesnika."

#: ../command-line.rst:202
msgid "Two-factor authentication reset"
msgstr "Ponastavitev dvofaktorske avtentikacije"

#: ../command-line.rst:206
msgid ""
"The super administrator has no recovery codes, and nobody above it to reset "
"its :ref:`second factor <pref_2fa>` from the interface. This command is the "
"way back in when its device is lost; like ``galette:superadmin:password``, "
"it runs on the machine hosting Galette, and that access stands as the "
"authentication."
msgstr ""
"Superadministrator nima obnovitvenih kod, prav tako pa nad njim ni nikogar, "
"ki bi lahko prek vmesnika ponastavil njegov :ref:`drugi faktor <pref_2fa>`. "
"Ta ukaz omogoča ponoven dostop v primeru izgube naprave; podobno kot "
"``galette:superadmin:password`` se izvaja na strežniku, na katerem je "
"nameščen Galette, pri čemer sam dostop do tega strežnika služi kot overitev."

#: ../command-line.rst:224
msgid ""
"Without option, the command removes the second factor of the super "
"administrator, which then logs in with its password alone:"
msgstr ""
"Brez dodatne možnosti ukaz odstrani drugi dejavnik za superadministratorja, "
"ki se nato prijavi zgolj s svojim geslom:"

#: ../command-line.rst:240
msgid ""
"``--login`` targets a member instead, by its login (not its email address); "
"its recovery codes are dropped as well. Administrators and staff members can "
"already do the same :ref:`from the member page <member_2fa_reset>`, the "
"command is there for when nobody can log in to do so."
msgstr ""
"``--login`` namesto tega cilja na člana na podlagi njegovega prijavnega "
"imena (in ne e-poštnega naslova); pri tem se izbrišejo tudi njegove "
"obnovitvene kode. Skrbniki in osebje lahko enako storijo že :ref:`prek "
"strani člana <member_2fa_reset>`; ta ukaz je na voljo za primere, ko se "
"nihče ne more prijaviti, da bi to izvedel."

#: ../command-line.rst:241
msgid ""
"``--clock`` keeps the second factor, and only forgets the last code accepted "
"for the account. This is what is needed after :ref:`the server clock went "
"backwards <faq_2fa>`."
msgstr ""
"``--clock`` ohrani drugi faktor, pozabi pa le zadnjo kodo, ki je bila "
"sprejeta za ta račun. To je potrebno v primeru, ko :ref:`ura na strežniku "
"teče nazaj <faq_2fa>`."

#: ../command-line.rst:242
msgid ""
"``--policy-off`` disables two-factor authentication for the whole instance, "
"the way out when something goes wrong for everybody at once. Second factors "
"are kept, and asked again once a policy is set. It cannot be combined with "
"the other options."
msgstr ""
"``--policy-off`` onemogoči dvostopenjsko preverjanje pristnosti za celotno "
"instanco; to je rešitev za primere, ko gre nekaj narobe za vse uporabnike "
"hkrati. Podatki o drugih dejavnikih preverjanja se ohranijo in sistem jih "
"ponovno zahteva, ko je znova določena ustrezna politika. Te možnosti ni "
"mogoče kombinirati z drugimi možnostmi."

#: ../command-line.rst:244
msgid ""
"Whatever the case, a lock on the account after too many wrong codes is "
"lifted too, and the reset is recorded in the history."
msgstr ""
"Kakorkoli že, odpravi se tudi blokada računa, do katere je prišlo zaradi "
"prevelikega števila napačnih kod, ponastavitev pa se zabeleži v zgodovini."

#: ../command-line.rst:246
msgid ""
"The command asks for confirmation; pass ``--force`` to run it without a "
"terminal."
msgstr ""
"Ukaz zahteva potrditev; za izvedbo brez terminala uporabite ``--force``."

#: ../command-line.rst:251
msgid "Mailing queue"
msgstr "Čakalna vrsta za pošiljanje"

#: ../command-line.rst:255
msgid ""
"When :ref:`sending limits <mail_throttling>` are configured, mass mailings "
"and reminders are queued rather than sent in one go. This command drains "
"what is pending:"
msgstr ""
"Ko so :ref:`omejitve pošiljanja <mail_throttling>` konfigurirane, so "
"množična pošiljanja in opomniki v čakalni vrsti, namesto da bi bili poslani "
"naenkrat. Ta ukaz črpa tisto, kar je na čakanju:"

#: ../command-line.rst:270
msgid ""
"Nothing is sent until that question is answered. Pass ``--force`` to skip "
"it, which is what an unattended run needs: without it, a non-interactive "
"call has no way to confirm and stops with an error rather than send."
msgstr ""
"Nič se ne pošlje, dokler ni odgovora na to vprašanje. Podajte ``--force``, "
"da ga preskočite, kar potrebuje nenadzorovano izvajanje: brez tega "
"neinteraktivnega klica ni mogoče potrditi in se namesto pošiljanja ustavi z "
"napako."

#: ../command-line.rst:276
msgid ""
"For more complete documentation, see :ref:`draining the mail queue "
"<mailing_queue_cron>`, and the :ref:`progress page <mailing_queue>` it "
"drains alongside."
msgstr ""
"Za popolnejšo dokumentacijo si oglejte :ref:`izčrpavanje poštne čakalne "
"vrste <mailing_queue_cron>` in :ref:`stran napredka <mailing_queue>`, ki jo "
"izprazni."

#: ../command-line.rst:279
msgid "Plugins commands"
msgstr "Ukazi vtičnikov"

#: ../command-line.rst:281
msgid ""
"You can list existing plugins using the ``galette:plugins:list`` command:"
msgstr "Obstoječe vtičnike lahko naštejete z ukazom ``galette:plugins:list``:"

#: ../command-line.rst:298
msgid "Available commands are:"
msgstr "Razpoložljivi ukazi so:"

#: ../command-line.rst:300
msgid "``galette:plugins:disable``: disable a plugin"
msgstr "``galette:plugins:disable``: onemogoči vtičnik"

#: ../command-line.rst:301
msgid "``galette:plugins:enable``: enable a plugin"
msgstr "``galette:plugins:enable``: omogoči vtičnik"

#: ../command-line.rst:302
msgid "``galette:plugins:install-db``: install a plugin database"
msgstr "``galette:plugins:install-db``: namestitev baze podatkov vtičnikov"

#: ../command-line.rst:306
msgid "Plugin database installation will remove any existing plugin tables!"
msgstr ""
"Namestitev baze podatkov vtičnikov bo odstranila vse obstoječe tabele "
"vtičnikov!"

#: ../command-line.rst:308
msgid ""
"For every plugin related command, you can precise which plugin(s) you want "
"to act on, use the ``--all`` flag or either rely on interactive mode:"
msgstr ""
"Za vsak ukaz, povezan z vtičnikom, lahko določite, na katerega(e) "
"vtičnika(e) želite ukrepati, uporabite zastavico ``--all`` ali pa se "
"zanašate na interaktivni način:"

#~ msgid "Check"
#~ msgstr "Preveri"
